          "worked": "The disjoint events $A\\cap B$ and $A\\cap\\overline{B}$ partition $A$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(A)&=P(A\\cap B)+P(A\\cap\\overline{B})\\\\P(A)&=pq+(p-pq)\\\\P(A)&=p\\end{align*}$$",
