          "worked": "The disjoint events $A\\cap B$ and $\\overline{A}\\cap B$ partition $B$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(B)&=P(A\\cap B)+P(\\overline{A}\\cap B)\\\\P(B)&=pq+(q-pq)\\\\P(B)&=q\\end{align*}$$\nUsing $P(A)=p$ from part (a),\n$$\\begin{align*}P(A)\\times P(B)&=p\\times q\\\\P(A)\\times P(B)&=pq\\\\P(A)\\times P(B)&=P(A\\cap B)\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, $A$ and $B$ are independent events.",
